    "title": "Photos: Hall vs. Tolland CIAC boys high school soccer - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jim Michaud ,\n2 hours ago Hall goalie Rodrigo Ballesteros (0) with a save as everyone tumbles during the play during the Tolland at Hall boys soccer game on Wednesday, September 3, 2025, in West Hartford. Hall’s Ben Goldstein (5) and Tolland’s Jackson Silvay (8) are also pictured. The play led to an unsuccessful penalty kick. (Jim Michaud/Hearst Connecticut Media) Photos from Hall's high school boys soccer match with Tolland on Wednesday.\nSign up for CT Insider newsletters here\nRead the original article on ctinsider.com",
